  "body": "## v16.51 \u2014 science and publication verified / actual-merge closure pending\n\nOne genuine ternary root with three arbitrary finite full binary children, centered on target hitting number two. The independent analytical review accepts the scoped composition argument; implementation and closure require the execution evidence below.\n\n- Exact verified parent: `4a2866132b53c8400e10c425e1461143d9f3bdd9`.\n- Prospective direct-child protocol: `0c4c4d6b771a36b370c3e5e9a2cec4f9485b97a1`.\n- Reviewed scientific source: `e0b88d35989c0e9998c75240a14e7e3f41f49259`.\n- [Full campaign run 36888010712](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36888010712): preflight, separate science/reproduction, publication, and later actual-merge/receipt gates.\n\n### Scientific target\nPreserve root hitting two during child repairs; keep all child interiors exact during root role transport, including the unique possible whole-palette child and local-hole permutations. Frozen shapes are three cherries and asymmetric cherry\u2013chain\u2013fork. Exactly 2,592 directed specification identities, including 864 with root target two. Minimum and one-spare palettes; independent total-excursion and minimum-width checks. Generality comes from the scoped proof, not finite enumeration. Repeated ternary composition remains outside scope; no nonunit witness is inferred from failed construction.\n\n### Development evidence and disclosed correction\nInitial RED run 36885588846 recorded two expected failures. Independent review found that the omission check reached only a helper and that the whole-palette control did not exercise its nonzero-anchor exception. [AMENDMENT_001](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/blob/e0b88d35989c0e9998c75240a14e7e3f41f49259/ResearchHistory/UQCF-GEM/demos/v16.51-ternary-interface/AMENDMENT_001.md) explicitly discloses the missed preimplementation verifier-level timing and earlier missing dependency installs. It prospectively substitutes full-verifier mutation evidence before definitive science; it does not rewrite that history.\n\nReview RED 36887031192 recorded four intended failures with zero errors: full verifier accepts omitted case under supplied-only mutation; removing full-palette exception loses endpoint; failed starts escape retention; scientific failure classifier absent. Corrective GREEN 36887590636 passed 44 scientific/coverage/failure controls and 33 integrity controls. Downloaded artifact hashes and exact logged test identities were audited. Source review accepts the corrections under the amendment.\n\nThe definitive campaign installs all pinned dependencies and requires **994 inherited +77 new =1,071 passing checks**, fresh byte-identical reproduction of all 36 parent scientific files, complete artifact/source/Git manifest closure, separate fresh reproduction, exact-head review/merge, actual-merge replay and independently published receipt decision.\n\nPrimary science and separate fresh reproduction passed: 2,592 cases, 92,352 primitive moves, 1,213 unit-excursion cases, 72 minimum-width checks, zero construction failures, and all 1,071 checks. All 39 scientific files (including 36 inherited files) reproduced byte-for-byte. Outcome: TERNARY_Q2_INTERFACE_VALIDATED; no nonunit witness claimed.\n\nPublication commit `3b2dd7850dad4a57b73c6191b0a0f5946b6e7de4`, tree `3829d2f4be44c3c19c72f990afcf6e45b4559817`: all 263 manifest members and both durable raw archives verified against Git blobs. Source remains unchanged. Science artifact 11176521228 SHA256 `a2c86338cb5e60291f0209d314391af2a41369ecb5be77ba59ff2464e58c50f6`; reproduction artifact 11175163573 SHA256 `2f87863c7e3e36b1f125ef3c42014dbdd87dd6be88847dbcb5ceb5e357f9d802`.\n\nNo completed-stage certification is claimed until actual-merge replay and independent receipt closeout pass. No external-auditor dependency exists.",
